add(679,[602],[4],'91–95','transitivité; R^if_*; Suite spectrale de Leray.','For composable morphisms of topoi f,g and an abelian sheaf F there is a functorial convergent spectral sequence R^pg_*R^qf_*F⇒R^{p+q}(gf)_*F; there is a bounded-below complex version and the corresponding global-cohomology specialization.','stated without proof as a short heading; full formula is a reconstruction',none,'A','The general topos formalism is part of the SGA4 programme. Exact modern statements and acyclicity hypotheses were opened in Stacks072X, Lemmas21.14.1–21.14.7; the source merely names the sequence.','SGA4 foundational publication1972; no separate priority date assigned to this already named Leray construction.','Established. This is ordinary direct-image transitivity, distinct from the later compact-support analogue CL-SA12-630.',['SA12_Stacks072X'],[35,36])
